//   bring your own device (MDM, containerization, policy): https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bring_your_own_device ; Wi-Fi Protected
//   Access (WPA2 from 2004, WPA3 announced January 2018): https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wi-Fi_Protected_Access ; network segmentation
//   (improved security by splitting a network into subnetworks): https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_segmentation ; endpoint
//   detection and response (continual monitoring of endpoints): https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Endpoint_detection_and_response ;
//   internet of things (patches often don't reach older and cheaper devices): https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Internet_of_things
